  "body": "## What happens\n\nEvery cargo command on main prints:\n\n    warning: unused workspace dependency `camcraft-gcode`\n      --> Cargo.toml:15:1\n       = help: consider removing the workspace dependency `camcraft-gcode`\n\nPR #3657 (`711314efd`) added the `camcraft-gcode` crate as a workspace member and also declared it in the root `[workspace.dependencies]`. No crate depends on it yet, so cargo warns. The warning appears in every gate and post-merge log, where it is noise next to real errors.\n\n## Done means\n\nThe root `Cargo.toml` has no `camcraft-gcode` entry in `[workspace.dependencies]` (the crate stays a workspace member), cargo prints no unused-dependency warning, and the issue that first uses the crate from another crate (#2218) adds the entry back with its decision record.\n",
